~ start

: The final barrier had been revealed. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/outro_world_restored.png] [#fade_in=8.0]
: The last message had been rewritten.
: The final path had been made clear.

: The Lands of the Prism were no longer silent.
: Signs could be understood.
: Words could be reached.
: Signals no longer depended on color alone.
: The world had begun to answer more than one way of perceiving it.

: But the kingdom was not safe yet.
: Far beyond the restored paths, Kalipso still waited.
: The dragon of the prophecy had awakened.
: And the final battle could no longer be delayed.

: Across the kingdom, the Royal Herald carried the news. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/outro_herald_announcement.png] [#cinematic=2.5]
: The roads were open.
: The gates could be reached.
: The warning could finally be understood.
: For the first time, the call for help could travel through the whole realm.

: And because of that...
: The hero could finally arrive. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/outro_hero_arrives.png] [#cinematic=2.3]

: Across the restored paths, the hero crossed the kingdom.
: The people of the Lands of the Prism watched as the final gate opened.
: The adventure that had once been blocked could now continue.

: At the end of the path, Kalipso was waiting. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/outro_dragon_battle.png] [#cinematic=2.5]
: The dragon of the prophecy had risen before the kingdom.
: But this time, the hero could reach the battlefield.
: And every change made along the journey had led to this moment.

: And so, the hero faced the dragon. [#fade_out]

: The battle became a story. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/outro_dragon_defeated.png] [#fade_in] [#cinematic=2.5]
: The story became a legend.
: And the legend became the ending the world had been waiting for.

: The game was finally complete.

: The End. [#fade_out]

: You woke up at your desk. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/outro_developer_wakes.png] [#fade_in=6.0] [#cinematic=7.0]
: The room was quiet.
: The monitor was still on.
: The game was running.

: No errors.
: No warnings.
: No blocked paths.

: For a moment, it felt like a dream.

: Then you saw it.

: The Resonance Codex was lying beside your keyboard. [#portrait=res://scenes/cutscenes/images/outro_codex.png] [#cinematic=1.5]
: Its pages were filled with everything you had discovered.
: Not just notes about the game.
: Knowledge about how worlds can include, guide, and welcome more people.

: The final build was ready.

: But this time, you understood what that really meant.

: Your game was ready to be shared. [#fade_out=8.0]
=> END